sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Git as GitHub
    participant CI as GitHub Actions
    participant AR as Artifact Registry
    participant TF as Terraform
    participant GKE as GKE
    participant Mon as Cloud Monitoring

    Dev->>Git: Commit code or Terraform change
    Git->>CI: Trigger pipeline
    CI->>CI: Run validation and tests
    CI->>AR: Build and push container image
    CI->>TF: Terraform plan/apply
    TF->>GKE: Provision/update infrastructure
    CI->>GKE: Deploy Kubernetes manifests
    GKE->>Mon: Send metrics and logs
    Mon->>CI: Deployment health feedback
